 HubSpot、Adobe 等应用的集成。测试版已上线，前两工具开放给付费用户，会议功能需企业版订阅。此前工具 Claude Cowork 主要面向非技术用户的工程师部分需求，现扩展至全体知识工作者。","sourceName":"The Verge · AI","sourceUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1030709/anthropic-has-its-own-ai-powered-office-suite-now","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T17:30:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/b360a0b28a4cc3f066128c38e337283bbce79f5b511877df2f99dc16915aca83.jpg","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/268d0239821ef3cacb17aa0a9476a08fd78d381a34c85b5c9dc15805ebd24e62.jpg 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/b360a0b28a4cc3f066128c38e337283bbce79f5b511877df2f99dc16915aca83.jpg 96w","itemId":"aq0l5fkjhuxes3ugqfdpztphv","title":"Anthropic发布Claude Fable 5.2与Mythos 5.2：评测与成本分析","summary":"Anthropic发布Claude Fable 5.2与Mythos 5.2，评测显示其在多个基准测试中排名第一（如GDPx 16.4%、HLE-Diamond 80%、AA-3D 1271 Elo），但成本较前代上涨20%至$8输入/$40输出 tokens。","sourceName":"Latent Space","sourceUrl":"https://latent.space/p/ainews-fable-5-2-retakes-world-1-llm-spot-as-ant-ipo-roadshow-begins/","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T06:34:44.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"r1d5l19l774uwtn9n60sb5lfc","title":"Spotify AI DJ 新增多语言声音与静音选项","summary":"Spotify AI DJ 新增多语言声音与静音选项，支持英语和西班牙语共9种个性化声音（含英国、美国、澳大利亚等口音），用户可关闭歌曲间评论。该功能已覆盖全球95个市场，超9400万Premium用户使用。访问方式：Spotify应用内搜索'DJ'并调整设置","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/10/spotifys-ai-dj-gets-new-voices-personalities-and-an-option-for-less-chatter/","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}]},{"label":"行业动态","summary":"纽约AI安全法生效要求超5亿美元公司合规申报，美国70%政府机构已采用生成式AI，微软发现Lazarus攻击可绕过安全评估。","items":[{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"k2o8sjiefxyykso8jzscvgh22","title":"Microsoft研究人员发现Lazarus攻击：通过激活AI模型休眠神经元可在触发条件下执行恶意命令","summary":"Microsoft研究人员发现Lazarus攻击：通过激活AI模型休眠神经元可在触发条件下执行恶意命令。该攻击无需模型微调，仅修改权重即可绕过标准安全评估。防御建议包括模型来源验证、容器扫描和AI驱动的权重检测，强调需将模型视为潜在内部威胁并限制其权限。","sourceName":"Microsoft Research","sourceUrl":"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/blog/lazare-veni-foras-reprogramming-dormant-neurons-to-backdoor-ai-agents/","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T20:52:56.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"l57lacm11hlp0vh3bhbtxk4gy","title":"美国公共部门工会与AI应用的监管博弈：70%政府机构已采用生成式AI","summary":"美国70%政府机构已采用生成式AI，公共部门工会通过多州立法和谈判争取监管权，包括加州禁止AI监控软件、纽约立法保护员工、宾夕法尼亚州要求OpenAI ChatGPT企业版必须有人类监督，以及俄亥俄州运输工会获得自动驾驶车辆否决权。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/nearly-70-percent-of-us-agencies-use-generative-ai-and-unions-are-finally-catching-up-with-guardrails/","publishedAt":"2026-11-13T15:53:49.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"bthsmafmicxeqe7evxfk94kzd","title":"xAI旗下Grok构建应用泄露患者数据及内部销售信息","summary":"Grok构建的应用存在大规模数据泄露风险，包括患者记录和内部销售信息。Claroc报告显示94.7%的未授权访问应用来自SpaceXSI员工，涉及企业销售团队名单、广告提案等敏感数据。SpaceXSI虽已下线24个涉事内部应用，但未修复其他用户公开应用的安全漏洞。此前已发生Grok泄露370万对话记录和用户文件上传事件，爱尔兰数据保护机构正在调查。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/grok-built-apps-exposed-patient-data-plaintext-passwords-and-spacexsis-own-sales-pipeline/","publishedAt":"2026-11-11T12:53:07.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f87867cb32a9719100390bc34297eb3c792ddbaa2b812bed160741e13b1c45c2.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/954587e32bfcc94b282e8b0ff51ea7bfa887b1c3bb0610d2a3304a6ef3f65294.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f87867cb32a9719100390bc34297eb3c792ddbaa2b812bed160741e13b1c45c2.webp 96w","itemId":"uagcv308o94wdape8ix85q7zm","title":"NVIDIA 开源贡献与 AI 基础设施更新：OpenShell 和 Agent Substrate 加入 CNCF","summary":"NVIDIA 在 KubeCon + CloudNativeCon 上贡献 OpenShell 和 Agent Substrate 到 CNCF 开源社区，并发布 DSX 平台的新组件以提升 Kubernetes 上的 GPU 基础设施管理效率。","sourceName":"NVIDIA Blog","sourceUrl":"https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/open-source-openshell-infrastructure/","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T16:00:03.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/d8005acd58268e7cd7fda60d43e180921e5eb3ac716974f75571ef865eaf42e1.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp 96w","itemId":"h1h4d753450i0n176rr641x5y","title":"三大AI购物助手被曝推荐虚假网站 Podqi测试显示Perplexity错误率最高达15%","summary":"Podqi测试显示：Perplexity推荐虚假网站率15%最高，ChatGPT为8%，Gemini仅4%。测试涵盖151个品牌，发现AI常推荐已注册/废弃的虚假区域站点。OpenAI称将加强防伪措施，Google强调会附带来源链接。研究建议用户验证推荐网站，并警示即将到来的购物季可能加剧风险。","sourceName":"The Verge · AI","sourceUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1032020/gemini-chatgpt-perplexity-shopping-test-risky-fake-websites-citations","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T17:00:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"tn9dempxn3yssqmqhwat78te2","title":"OpenAI 发布两款网络安全产品：Daybreak Red Team 和 Daybreak Defense Factory","summary":"OpenAI 发布两款网络安全产品：Daybreak Red Team 和 Daybreak Defense Factory。前者通过 AI 智能体自动探测网页应用漏洞，后者可自动化生成补丁并部署到代码库。两者均基于 GPT-6 Cyber 模型开发。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/openai-enters-the-cybersecurity-market-with-two-daybreak-products/","publishedAt":"2026-11-13T15:08:57.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"i12xwi9g7p8h3anmb8c1o4p11","title":"Anthropic CEO Amodei坦言明年存在巨大不确定性，IPO前揭示核心财务挑战","summary":"Anthropic CEO Amodei坦言明年存在巨大不确定性，IPO前揭示核心财务挑战。公司已投入近900亿美元用于计算资源，其中71亿美元将于2027年9月到期，远超多数标普500公司市值。Amodei提出通过动态采购计算资源和保持高现金储备来缓解风险，并计划通过IPO和私募融资共筹集约90.4亿美元，创史上最大IPO纪录。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-ceo-amodei-admits-theres-a-huge-uncertainty-in-whats-going-to-happen-next-year-days-before-a-record-ipo/","publishedAt":"2026-11-14T19:05:17.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"qiy8ed5hcb518cgsdzf60b7zw","title":"纽约AI安全法生效，OpenAI、Anthropic等需合规申报","summary":"纽约州于2026年11月10日宣布新AI安全法（RAISE法案）正式生效，要求年营收超5亿美元的大模型公司于2027年1月1日前完成注册、公开安全框架及72小时内报告重大事故。法案同步成立DIGIT监管办公室和AI责任研究中心，并与加州、伊利诺伊州形成监管联动。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/10/openai-anthropic-face-new-oversight-as-new-yorks-ai-safety-law-takes-effect/","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T20:52:13.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"u2r9v9ra7bsoz2dpvfnqu37q8","title":"Anthropic Fable 5.2 完成真实自由职业任务占比达41%","summary":"评测显示 Fable 5.2 完成真实自由职业任务占比达41%，超过 Opus 5.5 和 GPT-6 Astra 等竞品两倍以上。测试基于240个真实项目（总价值约14.4万美元），涵盖视频编辑、CAD设计、游戏开发等任务，Fable 5.2在3D建模、音频编辑和建筑设计领域表现突出。人类专家验证显示其完成复杂项目能力提升显著，但工业级产品设计和动画仍存短板。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/anthropics-fable-5-2-completes-41-percent-of-real-freelance-jobs-up-from-2-5-percent-a-year-ago/","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T14:07:47.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}]},{"label":"论文研究","summary":"AWS开源UAEF框架支持多维度AI代理评估，Antigravity发布teamwork协作工具解决数学与工程难题，Amazon SageMaker提出静默数据损坏的三种检测方法。","items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"h8p3jjqnri7gxeo113jxngsz0","title":"AWS发布UAEF框架：支持多框架AI代理闭环评估的开源系统","summary":"AWS推出开源评估框架UAEF，支持LangGraph、LangChain等框架的AI代理进行多维度指标（工具调用、响应质量、推理能力等）评估。系统通过适配器统一处理不同框架的执行轨迹，存储结果至DynamoDB/S3，生成对比报告和LLM辅助分析。案例显示企业客户通过该框架检测退化、优化提示词和模型，实现闭环迭代。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/uaef-a-framework-agnostic-system-for-closed-loop-evaluation-of-ai-agents/","publishedAt":"2026-11-11T15:50:55.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"xntund3bmho9l8hdst87i1s9s","title":"Antigravity发布/teamwork与Gemini 4协作工具，解决多项数学与工程难题","summary":"Antigravity发布新的多智能体协作工具/teamwork和(boost)，与Gemini 4模型合作解决了数学证明（如解决2013年Courtade–Kumar猜想）、量子计算、系统优化等领域多项长期未解问题，并已应用于Google生产基础设施优化。工具通过并行探索与专用验证器（如Lean 4证明器、未修改软件测试套件）自动验证解决方案，同时通过上下文分区防止多日任务中信息丢失。","sourceName":"Google Research","sourceUrl":"https://research.google/blog/advancing-science-engineering-with-antigravitys-teamwork-feature/","publishedAt":"2026-11-13T20:47:18.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"veryldoyvs8e4iaxuf62k4hrc","title":"Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 静默数据损坏检测与恢复方法","summary":"本文介绍了在Amazon SageMaker HyperPod中检测和恢复静默数据损坏的三种方法：1）梯度非有限值检查（捕获NaN/Inf异常）；2）环式回放审计（通过跨节点微批次复现验证计算路径错误）；3）权重指纹比较（检测更新后权重不一致）。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/detecting-and-recovering-from-silent-data-corruption-on-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod/","publishedAt":"2026-11-11T23:30:03.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}]},{"label":"技巧与观点","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"g2q66un3csjmgeguf3k5r21u8","title":"Amazon SageMaker HyperPod数据捕获助力模型优化飞轮","summary":"本文展示了如何利用Amazon SageMaker HyperPod数据捕获功能，记录实时推理数据并分析。通过Athena查询发现新家电品类识别盲区，编写SQL标签策略后进行LoRA微调，最终使新类别识别准确率从0%提升至100%，同时不影响原有类别表现。完整代码和测试数据在GitHub仓库中提供，支持在HyperPod集群上部署端到端闭环。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/build-a-model-improvement-flywheel-with-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-data-capture/","publishedAt":"2026-11-13T18:01:15.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"wsyantprlfkh6vtnr4mnpqocr","title":"Hugging Face发布TRELLIS.2 3D模型LoRA微调完整指南","summary":"Hugging Face发布基于LoRA的TRELLIS.2 3D模型微调教程，包含数据准备、训练命令和评估指标。教程使用188双鞋的GSO数据集，通过冷冻原始模型权重，仅微调控制物体形状和细节的DiT模块，最终使鞋底 Chamfer 距离降低66.7%（0.174→0.033），F-score提升186%（0.276→0.803）","sourceName":"Hugging Face Blog","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/blog/3d-lora-finetuning","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}]}],"flashes":[],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalStories":20,"selectedCount":125,"reportsCovered":5},"readingMinutes":9,"prev":"2026-W45","next":null}